[%- WRAPPER pod_wrapper.tt -%]
=head1 NAME

amzn-api-help

=head1 SYNOPSIS

 amzn-api-help [--no-cli-pager] [service] [shape|operation]

=head1 DESCRIPTION

The C<amzn-api-help> command provides POD help for AWS services,
operations, and shapes, generated on demand from Botocore metadata.

=head1 AVAILABLE SERVICES

=over 4

[% FOREACH s IN services -%]
=item C<[% s %]>

[% END -%]
=back

=head1 PERL MODULES

I<Check L<https://cpan.openbedrock.net/signature/index.html> for a list
of downloadable modules. Modules not currently available can be
requested there.>

=over 4

[% FOREACH m IN modules -%]
=item C<[% m %]>

[% END -%]
=back
[% END -%]
